# PO Diary (обязательно)

Stable source of truth: **`docs/PO-CANON.md`**.
Session history: **`docs/PO-DIARY.md` §5**.

## Start of session

Before proposing UX or priorities, read `docs/PO-CANON.md`.
Do not make PO re-explain character, demo pride, or “how I want it”.

## End of session

If this chat produced a **new** insight about PO (taste, refusal, quality bar, working style):

1. Append a dated entry at the top of §5 in `docs/PO-DIARY.md` (3–7 bullets, no transcript).
2. If it is stable, also update `docs/PO-CANON.md` (keep ≤80 lines).
3. Never log secrets/passwords.

Skip the update when nothing new about PO was learned.

## Why

PO’s gap with AI is usually **intent**, not coding skill. The diary closes that gap across chats.
